skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
participant "handlers\n«Media module»" as H $MEDIA
participant "messaging\n«Media module»" as M $MEDIA
participant "projections\n«Media module»" as P $MEDIA
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
[->> H : SQS event-source mapping result delivery
activate H
 H -> M : consume_result(s,body,apply_result)
 activate M
 group Media result transaction
  M -> DB : SQL: accept inbox UUID/hash
   M -> P : apply_result(s,body)
   activate P
   P -> DB : SQL: lock Asset; read accepted source + projection
   P -> P : validate_transition(current,event)
   opt validate_transition returned True
    P -> DB : SQL: flush projection + Asset
   end
   P --> M : bool (False for stale state)
   deactivate P
  M -> DB : COMMIT inbox + accepted state
 end
 M --> H : True for new inbox
 deactivate M
[<-- H : batchItemFailures (exceptions roll back and fail record)
deactivate H
legend bottom
New inbox identity shown; callback is handlers.consume_results.handle. Replay skips apply_result.
Stale state commits inbox; conflict rolls back. W3-13a details guards; W3-08a shows the later read.
endlegend
@enduml
